  "accepted_answers": [
    "Emperor Muzong",
    "Li Deming"
  ],
  "explanation": "The question asks for the father of Jingzong. There are two distinct referents named Jingzong in the sources: one is Emperor Jingzong of Tang, and the other is Emperor Jingzong of Western Xia. For Emperor Jingzong of Tang, D1S3 explicitly states that his father was Emperor Muzong. For Emperor Jingzong of Western Xia, D5S2 directly states that his father was Li Deming. These are separate individuals and their respective fathers are correctly identified in the sources. Other candidates like Emperor Xianzong of Tang, Wang Shenzhi, and Xi Zhongxun either refer to unrelated individuals or are not supported by the context."
}
